WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.380
Approve, with a comment.

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.020
The engine task finishes first.

3
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:10.540
Then the decision hits the descriptors, the timeline, and a Doxis comment on the document.

4
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.860
The requester gets an email, with a link back.

5
00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.020
Not an inbox.

6
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.380
Not a spreadsheet.

7
00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.800
The decision and its reason stay on the document, in Doxis.
